    {
      "id": "sensor-information",
      "label": "Sensor Information",
      "description": "Enter one or more sensors. Definitions:  - Platform is the type of asset, and this term is defined with options by ERDDAP. For WL, it is considered a ***REMOVED***station***REMOVED*** platform.   - Station is the physical location of a deployment. For example, West Dock Station.  - Instrument is the large physical instrument that may house individual or smaller components, aka sensors.   - Components are the individual sensors within an instrument. There may be multiple components within a single instrument.  Example two radar gauges within one instrument.  - Discriminant is the serial numbeer of the individual component(s), if applicable, or the instrument itself.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "prop": "sensors",
          "type": "object",
          "multiple": true,
          "tabs": [
            {
              "id": "overview",
              "label": "Overview",
              "fields": [
